Package: organoR
Title: Organisational Organograms from Tidy Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Iris", "Oren", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "iris.oren@gov.scot")
Description: Validates tidy organisational relationship data and creates
    grade-ranked, team-specific organograms using igraph, GraphViz and
    DiagrammeR. Cross-team and recursively linked managers are included.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
